1356560, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2q8.jpg"}, {"id": 1356561, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2q9.jpg"}, {"id": 1356562, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2qa.jpg"}, {"id": 1356563, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2qb.jpg"}, {"id": 1356557, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2q5.jpg"}, {"id": 1356565, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2qd.jpg"}, {"id": 1356564, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sct2qc.jpg"}], "slug": "my-monsters", "summary": "My Monsters is a VR action-adventure game that stands out for its 100% hand-painted art, immersing players in a world of fantasy and surrealism. The game's deep narrative explores humanity's greatest inner monsters, such as anxiety, fear, and loneliness. The player is transported to the dream-like world of Onirium, where they meet Moti, a frightened little monster with no memory.\n\nIn My Monsters, you are not alone; team up with your inner monster, Moti, and face various enemies, solve complex puzzles, and overcome challenges side by side. This unique partnership mechanic allows players to deeply connect with Moti, using empathy and courage to overcome obstacles and discover fragments of a meaningful dreamlike tale. Each stage of the game reveals new aspects of this collaborative relationship, culminating in moments of self-discovery and profound understanding.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/my-monsters", "videos": [{"id": 164370, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "kebexoFJX-Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kebexoFJX-Q", "title": "My Monsters | Official Launch Trailer | Meta Quest + Steam VR", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kebexoFJX-Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 119833, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "je_Lmcx0ZxY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=je_Lmcx0ZxY", "title": "M